/** Aggressively reclaims unreferenced Kotlin/Native objects so a delegate the library forgot to retain has every opportunity to be freed before we send. The 1 MiB allocation per round goes out of scope before the next iteration's `GC.collect()`, creating real allocation churn to exercise the collector. */
